2026-07-27T12:12:55.6980548Z i /tmp/RtmpHAV8Uh/duckdb
2026-07-27T12:12:55.6981050Z This is removed when the R session ends.
2026-07-27T12:12:55.6981644Z * Extensions are re-downloaded each session.
2026-07-27T12:12:55.6982168Z * Secrets are lost.
2026-07-27T12:12:55.6982975Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = TRUE) (or create ~/.duckdb) to keep them (suitable for most users).
2026-07-27T12:12:55.6984259Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = FALSE) to accept the temporary directory (and silence this message).
2026-07-27T12:12:55.6985546Z i See ?duckdb_storage for details and alternatives.
